// The saucer theremin: a sine that slides between notes with a wide, wobbling
// vibrato and a faint octave shimmer. #rate and #wobble follow the danger.
// @name theremin
// @mode legato
// @glide 0.3
// @gain 0.3
// @param cutoff 2400
// @param rate 5.5
// @param wobble 0.01

~vib: sin #rate >> mul #wobble >> add 1
~f: ~freq >> mul ~vib
~f2: ~f >> mul 2.004
~a: sin ~f
~b: tri ~f2 >> mul 0.2
~amp: ~gate >> adsr 0.2 0.4 0.85 0.8
out: mix ~a ~b >> lpf #cutoff 0.7 >> mul ~amp
